  description: Tape 5 using tape5-fnaf sound
  recording: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a7adafba59269b43b948744a85062ee, type: 3}
  subtitles:
  - text: They are alive! They are not robots! I saw the Bunny... it looked at me!
    duration: 5.5
  - text: It... it smiled! Not a mechanical smile... a real one!
    duration: 5
  - text: It chased me through the hallway. I barely made it out.
    duration: 3.5
  - text: The doors won't hold them forever. The power is draining too fast!
    duration: 4
  - text: I need to cut the main breaker. Maybe if I kill the power completely, they
      will shut down.
    duration: 5
  - text: "I\u2019m going to the Storage Room. God help me."
    duration: 3.5
